{"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/afluent\/backoffjitter"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"metadata":{"modules":[{"name":"Afluent"}],"title":"BackoffJitter","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"BackoffJitter"}],"symbolKind":"struct","platforms":[{"name":"iOS","deprecated":false,"unavailable":false,"beta":false,"introducedAt":"16.0"},{"name":"iPadOS","deprecated":false,"unavailable":false,"beta":false,"introducedAt":"16.0"},{"name":"Mac Catalyst","deprecated":false,"unavailable":false,"beta":false,"introducedAt":"16.0"},{"name":"macOS","deprecated":false,"unavailable":false,"beta":false,"introducedAt":"13.0"},{"name":"tvOS","deprecated":false,"unavailable":false,"beta":false,"introducedAt":"16.0"},{"name":"watchOS","deprecated":false,"unavailable":false,"beta":false,"introducedAt":"9.0"}],"roleHeading":"Structure","remoteSource":{"fileName":"BackoffJitter.swift","url":"https:\/\/github.com\/Tyler-Keith-Thompson\/Afluent\/blob\/main\/Sources\/Afluent\/RetryStrategies\/BackoffJitter.swift#L31"},"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"BackoffJitter"}],"role":"symbol","externalID":"s:7Afluent13BackoffJitterV"},"relationshipsSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/Afluent\/s8SendableP","doc:\/\/Afluent\/s16SendableMetatypeP"],"title":"Conforms To","kind":"relationships","type":"conformsTo"}],"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"minor":3,"patch":0},"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/Afluent\/documentation\/Afluent\/BackoffJitter","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/Afluent\/documentation\/Afluent"]]},"sections":[],"topicSections":[{"anchor":"Type-Properties","identifiers":["doc:\/\/Afluent\/documentation\/Afluent\/BackoffJitter\/none"],"title":"Type Properties","generated":true},{"anchor":"Type-Methods","identifiers":["doc:\/\/Afluent\/documentation\/Afluent\/BackoffJitter\/decorrelated(using:)","doc:\/\/Afluent\/documentation\/Afluent\/BackoffJitter\/equal(using:)","doc:\/\/